          "end": 850
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "3. According to learned Senior Counsel for the petitioners, the son of petitioners and respondent No.2, both of whom are Non-Resident Indian (NRI), got married in November, 2009 and during the period of last around 16 years, they stayed hardly for a period of six days with the petitioners in Patna",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 853,
      "end": 1151,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Patna",
          "label": "GPE",
